'''Constellation''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2024 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] in the [[Christmas Event 2024]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Constellation’s main body has a quite striking royal blue color, decorated with stars of different sizes in a gold color. Gold accents are also seen on the trigger, barrel and cylinder parts of the revolver suggesting a space theme and other elements associated with the universe.

== Trivia ==
*It has a partner knife under the name [[Celestial]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Celestial Set|Celestial Set]].
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Constellation]], which was found in the same box.
*Constellation was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*There are [[Red Constellation|red]], [[Bronze Constellation|bronze]], [[Silver Constellation|silver]], and [[Gold Constellation|gold]] reskins of this weapon.

